{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53352","headline":"杂句 一 · 庞藴","name":"杂句 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行路易，行路易，内外中间依本智。\n本智无情法不生，无生即是入正理。\n非色非心放一光，空里优昙显心地。\n名爲智，智爲尊，心智通同达本源，万物同归不二门。\n有非有兮理常存，无非无兮无有根，未来诸佛亦如是，现在还同古世尊。\n三世俱皆无别道，佛佛相授至今传。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}